[hr][hr]

[center][b][size=5]🗺️ SurveyorMap[/size][/b][/center]
[center]Persistent client-side minimap in the bottom-left HUD — mirrors the native R.E.P.O. map with full fidelity, no fake overlays.[/center]

[hr]

[b][size=4]✨ What it does[/size][/b]

SurveyorMap reads the game's own map camera and displays a persistent minimap in the bottom-left HUD during gameplay. Same geometry, same colours, and same fidelity as the TAB map — no owned render textures, no fake overlays.

Adjust position, size, and zoom without leaving the game, with cursor unlocked and camera frozen during editing.

[hr]

[b][size=4]🎯 Features[/size][/b]

[list]
[*][b]Persistent minimap[/b] — bottom-left HUD, visible only during gameplay. Disappears in menus and lobby.
[*][b]Native map fidelity[/b] — reads the game's own map camera ([font=Courier New]activeTexture[/font]). Same geometry, colours, and wall fidelity as the TAB map.
[*][b]M key[/b] — press to show/hide the minimap without affecting the native TAB map.
[*][b]TAB-safe[/b] — the minimap hides automatically when you open the TAB map. The native map is unaffected.
[*][b]F8 Edit Mode[/b] — cursor unlocked and camera suspended automatically. Drag, resize, and adjust without spinning the player's view. Config saved on exit.
[*][b]Scroll (in F8)[/b] — adjusts minimap size.
[*][b]+ / -[/b] — adjust zoom inside or outside F8.
[*][b]Optional enemy markers[/b] — shape and colour indicate threat level. Dead enemies cleaned up in ~2s.
[*][b]Silent by default[/b] — DebugLogging=false. Emits only one line in normal use.
[*][b]Client-side[/b] — no other players need to install it. No RPCs. No network changes.
[/list]

[hr]

[b][size=4]🎮 Controls[/size][/b]

[list]
[*][b]M[/b] (any context) — Show / hide the minimap
[*][b]F8[/b] (any context) — Enter / exit edit mode
[*][b]Drag[/b] (F8 active) — Reposition the minimap
[*][b]Scroll[/b] (F8 active) — Adjust size
[*][b]+ / -[/b] (F8 active) — Adjust zoom
[*][b]R[/b] (F8 active) — Reset to default values
[*][b]+ / -[/b] (normal gameplay) — Adjust zoom with EnableZoomHotkeysOutsideEdit=true (on by default)
[/list]

[hr]

[b][size=4]👁️ Enemy marker visual system[/size][/b]

Shape and colour both indicate threat level — redundantly — for maximum readability on a small minimap.

[list]
[*][b]Low (Easy)[/b] — Circle · Ice-green (#DFFFE8)
[*][b]Medium[/b] — Square · Dark blue (#1E6BFF)
[*][b]High[/b] — Triangle · Lilac (#C084FC)
[*][b]Critical (Elite)[/b] — Star · Red/coral (#FF3B30)
[/list]

Threat level is derived from the enemy's [font=Courier New]difficulty[/font] field. Name/type keywords can only elevate the tier (never reduce it):

[list]
[*][font=Courier New]veryheavy[/font] → elevated to at least High (triangle/lilac)
[*][font=Courier New]trudge, slow walker, boss, elite[/font] → elevated to Critical (star/red)
[*][font=Courier New]hunt, huntsman, bang, rush, charge[/font] → elevated to at least High (triangle/lilac)
[/list]

[hr]

[b][size=4]👥 Multiplayer[/size][/b]

[b]Only the player who wants the minimap needs to install it.[/b] The mod is purely client-side.

[list]
[*][b]Only you have the mod[/b] — the minimap appears only for you; other players are unaffected
[*][b]Everyone has the mod[/b] — each player sees their own minimap normally
[*][b]Nobody has the mod[/b] — no effect
[/list]

SurveyorMap does not send RPCs, does not alter networking, and does not require other players to install it.

[hr]

[b][size=4]⚙️ Configuration[/size][/b]

Edit [font=Courier New]BepInEx/config/com.hiarlyscripter.surveyormap.cfg[/font] or use [b]REPOConfig[/b] in-game:

[b]EnableMinimap[/b] [i](Section: Minimap · default: true)[/i]
Enable/disable the minimap HUD.

[b]ToggleKey[/b] [i](Section: Minimap · default: M)[/i]
Key to toggle the minimap.

[b]Width / Height[/b] [i](Section: Minimap · default: 260)[/i]
Initial minimap size in pixels.

[b]PosX / PosY[/b] [i](Section: Minimap · default: 24 / 120)[/i]
Initial position — offset from the left and bottom edges.

[b]Zoom[/b] [i](Section: Minimap · default: 2.25)[/i]
Native map camera orthographic zoom factor.

[b]Opacity[/b] [i](Section: Minimap · default: 0.85)[/i]
Minimap opacity (0 = invisible, 1 = fully opaque).

[b]ShowEnemies[/b] [i](Section: Features · default: true)[/i]
Show enemy markers on the map.

[b]EnemyMarkerSize[/b] [i](Section: Features · default: 0.95)[/i]
Marker scale (0.30–2.00). Applies within ~2s without restart.

[b]RevealRoomsMode[/b] [i](Section: Features · default: Vanilla)[/i]
Vanilla = default (TAB stays original). NativeGlobal = reveals rooms via SetExplored (also affects TAB).

[b]EditModeKey[/b] [i](Section: EditMode · default: F8)[/i]
Key to enter/exit edit mode.

[b]UnlockCursorInEditMode[/b] [i](Section: EditMode · default: true)[/i]
Unlocks the cursor automatically when entering F8 edit mode.

[b]FreezeCameraInEditMode[/b] [i](Section: EditMode · default: true)[/i]
Freezes the camera when entering F8. Control is restored on exit.

[b]EnableZoomHotkeysOutsideEdit[/b] [i](Section: EditMode · default: true)[/i]
Allows + / - to adjust minimap zoom during normal gameplay without entering F8.

[b]DebugLogging[/b] [i](Section: Debug · default: false)[/i]
Verbose logging to BepInEx/LogOutput.log. Enable only for diagnostics.

[hr]

[b][size=4]📦 Requirements[/size][/b]

[b]Required[/b]
[list]
[*][b]BepInExPack 5.4.2100[/b] — base framework for R.E.P.O. mods
[/list]

[b]Optional[/b]
[list]
[*][b]REPOConfig[/b] — edit settings inside the game without opening config files
[/list]

[hr]

[b][size=4]🛠️ Installation[/size][/b]

[b]Via Vortex (recommended):[/b]
[list]
[*]Install [b]BepInExPack[/b] first
[*]Use the [b]Mod Manager Download[/b] button on Nexus — Vortex installs automatically into the correct structure
[*]Or manually: copy [font=Courier New]BepInEx/plugins/HiarlyScripter-SurveyorMap/SurveyorMap.dll[/font] to the game directory
[/list]

The config file will be generated automatically at [font=Courier New]BepInEx/config/com.hiarlyscripter.surveyormap.cfg[/font] on first run.

[hr]

[b][size=4]❓ Troubleshooting[/size][/b]

[b]Minimap doesn't appear[/b]
Confirm the mod loaded by opening [font=Courier New]BepInEx/LogOutput.log[/font] and searching for [font=Courier New][SurveyorMap][/font]. Also make sure you're inside an active level (not the menu or lobby).

[b]Minimap appears in menu or lobby[/b]
Normal behaviour — the minimap hides automatically outside gameplay. If it persists, toggle it off and on with M.

[b]Camera still moves during F8[/b]
If [font=Courier New]FreezeCameraInEditMode=true[/font] and the camera still rotates, press ESC once to manually release the cursor. The mod reapplies the freeze every frame.

[b]Mod doesn't load[/b]
Verify [b]BepInExPack[/b] is installed and active. Check [font=Courier New]BepInEx/LogOutput.log[/font] for error messages.

[hr]

[b][size=4]📋 Notes[/size][/b]

[list]
[*][b]RevealRoomsMode = NativeGlobal[/b] calls RoomVolume.SetExplored() — this also reveals rooms in the native TAB map. Intentional opt-in. Default is Vanilla.
[*][b]DebugLogging = false[/b] by default — emits only one line in normal use. Enable only for diagnostics.
[/list]

